      "content": "The placeholder Attribute"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The placeholder attribute describes a hint (a text) on what to enter in fields such as text, email, password and textarea."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here's an example:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<form>\n2\n3  <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter email.\"><br>\n4  <input type=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"Enter password.\"><br>\n5  <textarea name=\"description\" placeholder=\"Describe yourself\" rows=\"5\" cols=\"40\"></textarea><br>\n6  <input type=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\">\n7\n8</form>"
    },
